 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"29789272-8cf3-4bed-a3e2-acefccc5acd4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
From the centre of a 3 \[Times] 3 grid eight rays leave, two through each \
neighbour, each ending at a corner.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3ec9ff18-7774-4ac5-a044-a5448ce2ba41"],

